  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nX + Y = 20 days\n\nY alone = 25 days\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n1/(X+Y) + 1/Y = 1/X\n\n1/(X + Y) = 1/20\n\n1/X = 1/20 - 1/25\n\n⇒ 1/X = (25 - 20) / (20×25)\n\n⇒ 1/X = 5 / 500\n\n⇒ 1/X = 1 / 100\n\n**⇒ X = 100 days**",
